        "pattern": "image-fade-in",
        "reducedMotionFallback": "instant-visible"
      }
    },
    {
      "section": "content.title-text",
      "content": {
        "title": "A personality of kindness in the UI",
        "body": [
          {
            "text": "We created a visual world that feels a little different from what you'd expect from a technology studio. Custom illustrations, distinctive characters, subtle interactions, and animation give the site its personality, while the content introduces the studio's approach to websites, platforms, search, and AI."
          },
          {
            "text": "The challenge was making something that felt friendly and approachable without losing the sophistication behind the work. Every detail, from how things move to how complex ideas are explained, was an opportunity to show that good technology doesn't need to feel complicated."
          }
        ],
        "highlight": "kindness"
